{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 30, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and unique blend of traditional and modern culture. I spent my days exploring the city's many temples and shrines, including the famous Meiji Shrine, where I was surrounded by towering trees and serene gardens.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. The fish was incredibly fresh and delicious, and the lively atmosphere of the market was infectious. I also had the opportunity to visit the historic city of Kyoto, where I strolled through the beautiful Arashiyama bamboo forest and admired the stunning Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion.\n\nThroughout my journey, I was impressed by the Japanese culture's emphasis on respect and politeness. From the courteous service at restaurants and shops to the tranquil gardens and temples, I felt a deep sense of peace and tranquility. Japan is a country that seamlessly blends tradition with innovation, and I was amazed by the cutting-edge technology and modern architecture that coexists with ancient customs and rituals. My trip to Japan was a truly enriching experience that left me with unforgettable memories and a newfound appreciation for this fascinating culture.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.42304468154907227}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0032410495914518833}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.271740287251305e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20429912209510803}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.4816954731941223}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003793711948674172}, {"token": " e